[UPLOADED] /home/user/datasets/my-dataset/image3.jpg (UCv7MeuvEqo7PYElatEn) / annotations = OK
```

## Example: list datasets

List all datasets in your workspace

```bash
$ roboflow list-datasets -w my-workspace
```

